      "statement": "The canonical cedar failure was a GitHub 403 with token_valid=true and personal_repository_access=true, while the same record also shows organization_oauth_policy=restricted and organization_app_approval=pending. This matches an org-approval/policy split rather than a general invalid-token failure.",
